  "mindfulness_trim_note": {
    "anchor_verbatim": "So I will start with the first set of questions.",
    "boundary_turn_index": 0,
    "dropped_chars": 1198,
    "dropped_words": 195,
    "dropped_prefix_verbatim": "Thank you so much everybody for taking the time to participate in this focus group. I will now introduce what we are going to do. So in this focus group, we will explore questions that are meant to create effective self-administered mindfulness interventions tailored for individuals facing time and financial constraints, while seeking stress relief. The idea of this intervention is that it is practical, impactful, and accessible to individuals experiencing medium to high levels of stress. We will try to identify key components for stress reduction. And we will also discuss other key elements of this intervention such as duration and frequency for the audio mindfulness tracks that will be part of this intervention. If we have time, we'll discuss the critical aspects of creating a balanced control group for the research that will match the mindfulness intervention. Throughout the discussion, feel free to share your thoughts openly, there are no wrong or right answers. And you may not answer all the questions, just feel free to answer the questions you want to answer. You will take turns. And I will moderate the session, meaning I won't provide myself an answer to these questions."
  },
